-distance relationships\" href=\"/guides/what-to-write-when-you-miss-your-girlfriend/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Wishly Miss You template preview for a personal message\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/miss-you-template.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Long-Distance Relationships</span><h3>What to Write When You Miss Your Girlfriend: Sweet and Sincere Message Ideas</h3><p>Find thoughtful messages for when you miss your girlfriend, including long-distance texts, voice-note prompts and a simple digital letter outline.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>8 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a></div><div class=\"article-callout\"><h3>Make a thoughtful moment shareable</h3><p>Explore Wishly's templates and customise a personal website with your own text and photos.</p><a class=\"premium-button premium-button-primary\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Browse Wishly templates →</a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n<div class=\"premium-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n<a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n</a>\n<p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n<a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Main Wishly website ↗</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/topics/love-and-romance/\">Love &amp; romance</a><a href=\"/topics/emotional-support/\">Emotional support</a><a href=\"/topics/communica